   \item The current \textsc{M-OS-EVAL} benchmark dataset, while comprehensive in its evaluation dimensions, is based on 10 reviews per product. While this offers meaningful insights, expanding the dataset to encompass a larger and more diverse set of reviews would better capture the variety and complexity of real-world e-commerce scenarios.

