\section{Implementation Details} \label{imp_detail}
All experiments were conducted on $8$ NVIDIA $A100-SXM4-80GB$ clusters, providing ample computational power for robust analyses.
\subsection{M-OS-GEN Implementation Details:} \label{gen_imp_detail}
For inference, we configured both closed-source and open-source LLMs. After extensive experimentation, we selected \verb|top_k=25, top_p=0.95| and \verb|temperature=0.2| to generate deterministic, coherent outputs that effectively capture the comprehensive fine-grained product details, ensuring consistent and reliable performance across all models. 

