The objective is to optimize the dual-function transmit waveform $\vectsf X$ to  maximize the eMBB transmission rate, while ensuring that the URLLC decoding error probability $\epsilon_{b, \U}$ remains below a threshold and the target detection probability $P_{b,\D}$ exceeds a threshold across all blocks. 
