	In~\cite{dubuc}, it is proved that all 8-bit cubic \emph{bent} functions are normal. With our results, we can generalize this statement even further:

	\begin{theorem}
		All Boolean cubics in $\boole(8)$ are normal or weakly normal.
	\end{theorem}
	\begin{proof}
		By Theorem~\ref{CUBICFACT7}, all Boolean cubics in $\boole(7)$ are normal or weakly normal. Using Eq.~\eqref{eq: Drkm leq computing} and applying Lemma~\ref{MONO}, we get that $$D^\dag_{4}(3, 8)\le D_{4}(3, 7)=\max\{ D^\dag_{4}(1, 7),D^\dag_{4}(2, 7),D^\dag_{4}(3, 7)\}=1,$$
