At each step, we need to compute $T\mathcal{G}(u_{k})$, where $2$ PDEs are required to calculate $\mathcal{G}(u_{k})$, and $2N_{\text{ite}}$ PDEs to solve $T\mathcal{G}(u_{k})$ for accuracy.
We currently choose $N_{\text{ite}}$ as $10$.
